body='<header><div class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">HAF 0.3 / CASE STUDY  ·  2026.10.26</div><h1>东方明珠<br>从球体到结构</h1><p class="lead">V1 方块复原研究版。把三根主筒、斜撑和十一颗球分开建造，让窗带回到实体球壳之间。</p><div><span class="tag">Java 1.21.1</span><span class="tag">纯图片＋设计者资料</span><span class="tag">实机待验收</span></div><div class="metrics"><div><b>28,198</b><small>最终 NBT 方块数</small></div><div><b>89×223×89</b><small>完整包围盒 / 格</small></div><div><b>15</b><small>同源固定评审视角</small></div></div>'+dl(RUN/'building.nbt','下载 Pearl_V1.nbt','Pearl_V1.nbt')+'<a class="button" href="#model">查看建筑</a></div>'+pic('overview.png','最终 NBT 预览；非游戏截图')+'</div></header>'
